function.description:
Search insurance providers by name

Lookup insurance_providers records by optional name filter.

### Responses:

**200**: Successful Response (Success Response)
Content-Type: application/json

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "insurance_providers": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Name"
    }
  ]
}
```

List specialties with optional name filter

